      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "THOUGHTFUL (4) doesn't win out of turn but ran a strong race last time out over 1600m at Murtoa, finishing second beaten just 1.5 lengths. Has been more consistent than most others in this race of late and gets the chance to break through. BRUZANI (1) made significant late ground last start to get up for third over 1550m at Mt Gambier. Has a win and two placings at this journey from five starts. Will be hard to hold out again. ON THE MAP (8) gets a change of rider and has been freshened up since finishing 13th over 1500m at Morphettville last start. Can feature prominently. STATE OF MAINE (9) finished strongly for second last start, which was only the second run of the prep. Nearing peak fitness now and suited up in trip. DARK HARMONY (2) missed the placings two runs back then didn't do any better last start when 5.5 lengths away in seventh over 1628m at Donald. The engagement of Linda Meech is a positive move, which might spark improvement.",
